Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.72,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}THIS SOUND HAS\NPLAYED FOR 40 YEARS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:01.92,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THIS SOUND HAS BEEN BROADCASTING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.89,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FOR FORTY YEARS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:04.89,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}NOBODY KNOWS WHO IS SENDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:05.34,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:07.27,CAPRED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THREE SOUNDS SCIENCE CANNOT EXPLAIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:23.05,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#1  THE BUZZER — UVB-76
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.56,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.67,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE BUZZER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:11.49,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}A RUSSIAN SHORTWAVE STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.99,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}BUZZING SINCE THE SEVENTIES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.53,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SOMETIMES IT STOPS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:16.62,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND A VOICE READS NAMES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.43,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND NUMBERS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:19.69,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IN TWENTY-TEN IT WENT COMPLETELY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:21.03,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}SILENT FOR WEEKS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.64,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THEN IT CAME BACK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.04,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND SOMEONE WAS STILL COUNTING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:38.70,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#2  THE TAOS HUM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:23.87,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TWO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:24.81,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE TAOS HUM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.50,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IN ONE TOWN IN NEW
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:25.95,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}MEXICO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.08,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}TWO PERCENT OF PEOPLE HEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.82,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}A LOW DIESEL ENGINE THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:30.83,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ISN'T THERE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.17,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONLY INDOORS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:33.32,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ONLY AT NIGHT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:35.27,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}MICROPHONES HAVE NEVER CAUGHT IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:36.14,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THEIR BRAINS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.38,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}OR SOMETHING ELSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.23,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IS GENERATING IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:55.95,CHIP,,0,0,0,,#3  THE FEAR FREQUENCY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:39.51,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THREE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:41.26,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE FEAR FREQUENCY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.06,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}ENGINEER VIC TANDY FELT DREAD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.49,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AND SAW A GREY SHAPE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:45.51,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IN HIS LAB.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:46.99,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}HE MEASURED THE ROOM: INFRASOUND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.65,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}AT EIGHTEEN POINT NINE EIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.35,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}HERTZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:50.08,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}THE SAME FREQUENCY THAT MAKES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.58,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}YOUR EYEBALL VIBRATE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:52.22,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}HAUNTINGS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:52.96,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}IT TURNS OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:53.89,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}CAN BE A FAN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:58.60,HOOK,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)\t(0,220,\fs96)}HEADPHONES\NON. FOLLOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.86,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}PUT YOUR HEADPHONES ON AND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:58.31,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}FOLLOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.30,CAP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,90)}PART TWO HUMS BACK.
